Split the combined guard into two hinted checks so the common valid-profile/valid-index path remains fall-through and the cold null/out-of-range cases are outlined.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(profile == NULL, 0))
        return 0;
    if (__builtin_expect(profileIndex >= profile->numFields, 0))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
```